                <pb facs="0170" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg96"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">State of New Hampshire</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >County of Hillsborough</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">ss</hi>:</p>
                <p>Personally appeared the above-named John Ferguson, on this 21st day of March, A.
                    D. 1866, and subscribed and made oath to the above deposition. I further certify
                    that said John Ferguson is a physician of good reputation, in said Manchester,
                    and all representations made by him are entitled to full faith and credit.</p>
                <p>Witness my hand and official seal.</p>

                <p>{2 cent rev. stamp}</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAVID CROSS, <hi rendition="#italic">Judge of Probate for said County of
                            Hillsborough.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
